// Title: PUA - Chisel Tunneling Tool Execution
// Rule ID: 8b0e12da-d3c3-49db-bb4f-256703f380e5
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1090.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_pua_chisel.yml
